## 🎯 QUICK START (5 minutes)

### Option 1: Run Locally (Development)

```bash
# Terminal 1 - Backend
cd backend
npm install
npm start

# Terminal 2 - Frontend  
cd frontend
npm install
node ../server.js

# Visit: http://localhost:3000
```

### Option 2: Run with Docker (Production)

```bash
# Install Docker if needed
# https://docs.docker.com/get-docker/

# Build and run
docker-compose up -d

# Visit: http://localhost
```

